* A final, unperturbed .op (all five vos_* sources at their own "dc 0"
* default) supplies the saturation-headroom and amp tail_bias/ibias
* operating-point measures in tb.json: AC#3 ("re-verify headroom across the
* full PVT grid ... including MCB's W/L and the amp's tail_bias/ibias
* operating point, which moves with any core resize"). Margin = Vds - Vdsat
* (PMOS: Vsd - Vdsat, both reported by ngspice as positive magnitudes for a
* device in saturation) -- must stay >= 0 at every corner for the device to
* remain in saturation.

